"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就算听到开门的声音\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就算听到猫的叫声</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">当然还有人的声音</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我都能看见波形！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">↑</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（这算职业病吗？（笑））</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就像制作电影音效一样</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">有时会录下实际的声音</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">再制作出来</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">有时也会用合成器</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">来制作</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不管哪一种都很开心！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">顺带一提</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这个波形</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/001-8042e4037f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/001-8042e4037f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是\n居然\n1秒钟的声音\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nX轴表示时间\n所以就是音高\nY轴表示音量\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n放大之后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/002-e61e190d24.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/002-e61e190d24.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n（从左端起点放大）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n0.01秒之中\n居然也有这么多波！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/003-95eaa0b5d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/003-95eaa0b5d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（从最左端到最右端只有0.01秒！）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不同音量的正弦波\n复杂地重叠在一起\n就变成了声音\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所谓音乐是时间艺术\n音效也确实是\n时间艺术\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 红·绿的时候\n我也想着要制作出\n谁都没听过的声音\n所以制作了\n战斗招式的音效\n以及信息推进的声音！\n\n<br>\n\n然后叫声也一样\n为了让人感受到生物的存在\n我还设想着让音高随着进化发生变化\n考虑了各种各样的事情\n开心地制作了出来！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n总觉得\n好像很开心喵（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/004-cc6accdb7d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/004-cc6accdb7d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（在高处看热闹w）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n（附带内容）\n想详细了解声音的话\n请一定去查查\n傅里叶变换！\n\n<br>\n\n这个世界竟然是由噪声和正弦波\n构成的\n真是让人惊讶（笑）\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">音を作ること！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">音フェチとしては</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">これは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">楽しい作業（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">1音作るのに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">1日や2日かかることもあるけど</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">苦じゃないんです（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ドアを開ける音を聞いても\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">猫の鳴き声聞いても</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">もちろん人の声も</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">波形が見える！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">↑</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（これ職業病？（笑））</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">映画の効果音制作のように</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">実際の音を録音して</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作る事もあるし</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">シンセサイザーで</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作る事もあるけど</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">どちらも楽しい作業！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ちなみに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この波形</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/001-8042e4037f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/001-8042e4037f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれで\nなんと\n1秒の音なんです\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nX軸が時間なので\n音程になり\nY軸が音量になります\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n拡大していくと・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/002-e61e190d24.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/002-e61e190d24.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n（左端起点に拡大）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n0.01秒の中にも\nこんなに波があるんです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/003-95eaa0b5d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/003-95eaa0b5d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（左端から右端まてで0.01秒！）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n異なる音量のサイン波が\n複雑に重なって\n音になっています\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n音楽は時間芸術と\n言われたりしますが\n効果音もまさに\n時間芸術\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケットモンスター 赤・緑の時も\n誰も聞いたことがない音を\n作ろうと思って\n戦闘の技の音や\nメッセージ送り音を作ってました！\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして鳴き声も\n生き物を感じるように\n進化すると音程変化するようにと\nいろいろ考えて\n楽しんで作ってました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nにゃんだか\n楽しそうだにゃ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/004-cc6accdb7d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2648469/004-cc6accdb7d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n（高みの見物w）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n音について詳しく知りたい方は\nぜひ フーリエ変換を\n調べて見てくださいね！\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの世はノイズとサイン波\nで出来ていることに\n驚かされます（笑）\n\n<br></div>"}}